2. DATA
================================================================================

No real patient images are contained in this repository, and none may be added
to it. The demo images directory carries its own README saying so.

Development, training and evaluation used the following public datasets. They
are NOT redistributed here, they are NOT covered by this repository's licence,
and each is governed by its own terms — obtain them from their own source and
accept those terms yourself:

  APTOS 2019 Blindness Detection
    Asia Pacific Tele-Ophthalmology Society, hosted by Kaggle.
    https://www.kaggle.com/c/aptos2019-blindness-detection
    Kaggle competition rules apply, including restrictions on commercial use.

  EyePACS / Diabetic Retinopathy Detection
    EyePACS LLC, hosted by Kaggle.
    https://www.kaggle.com/c/diabetic-retinopathy-detection

  Messidor-2
    Methods to Evaluate Segmentation and Indexing Techniques in the field of
    Retinal Ophthalmology. Kindly provided by the Messidor program partners.
    https://www.adcis.net/en/third-party/messidor2/
    Messidor-2 requires acceptance of its own licence agreement and requires
    that publications using it cite the Messidor programme.

Grading follows the International Clinical Diabetic Retinopathy severity scale
(grades 0–4: no DR, mild, moderate, severe, proliferative).


